    "en": {
      "trackName": "WristJoy: 60 Watch Games",
      "description": "61 games. One Apple Watch. Endless quick breaks.\n\nWristJoy turns your watch into a pocket arcade with puzzle, action, board, card, sports and relaxing games built for your wrist.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE WRISTJOY\n• 61 games in one compact collection\n• Play offline—no Wi-Fi or mobile data needed\n• Quick sessions for commutes, queues and coffee breaks\n• Touch, Digital Crown and haptic controls designed for Apple Watch\n• Game Center leaderboards in selected games\n\nFIND YOUR NEXT FAVORITE\nTrain your brain with Sudoku, 2048, Minesweeper, Sokoban, Water Sort and maze puzzles. Chase high scores in Snake, Breakout, Space Shooter and endless runners. Slow things down with Chess, Reversi, Mahjong, Spider Solitaire, billiards and more.\n\nLeave your phone in your pocket and start a game right from your wrist.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicyforwristjoy\nTerms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/termsofserviceforwristjoy\nSupport: i@ztyuu.com",
      "releaseNotes": "New game: Bird Stack. This update also improves Tetris high scores, Breakout leaderboard submissions, Billiards gameplay, sound, and Watch-to-iPhone connection reliability.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wristjoy-60-watch-games/id6749552596?uo=4",
